{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Minimum observability standard for a Temporal application team: is it OK, is work flowing, have I got capacity.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Am I OK?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Workers alive",
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (instance) (temporal_worker_task_slots_available{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"})) or vector(0)",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How many Worker processes are reporting.\n\nZERO IS THE ALARM. When your fleet dies these metrics stop EXISTING rather than going to zero, so a threshold alert cannot catch it \u2014 that is what AppWorkerFleetAbsent is for. This tile shows 0 via `or vector(0)`.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget remaining",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 11,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "clamp_min(appslo:error_budget_remaining:ratio, -1)",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{sli}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "One tile per SLO. Green >25% left, orange 0-25%, red means the SLO has been missed for the window. Saturates at -100%.\n\nRead the number, not only the colour \u2014 green and orange are near-indistinguishable under protanopia.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#ec835a",
                "value": 0.0001
              },
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "no traffic",
          "min": -1,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Workflow failure ratio (5m)",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n  sum(rate(temporal_workflow_failed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n  or sum(rate(temporal_workflow_completed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0\n)\n/ clamp_min(\n  sum(rate(temporal_workflow_completed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n  + (sum(rate(temporal_workflow_failed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n     or sum(rate(temporal_workflow_completed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0),\n  0.001)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Terminal Workflow failures \u2014 NOT Activity failures, which retries absorb and which you should not page on.\n\nThe `or \u2026 * 0` guard matters: temporal_workflow_failed_total does not exist until your first failure, and without the guard this reads empty exactly when everything is failing.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#ec835a",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is work flowing?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Workflow outcomes",
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(temporal_workflow_completed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "completed"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(temporal_workflow_failed_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "failed"
        }
      ],
      "description": "'failed' is absent until your first failure \u2014 an empty line here is usually 'never happened', not 'healthy'. Prove your alerting by causing a failure, not by waiting for one.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "completed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#0ca30c"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#d03b3b"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Task delivery \u2014 schedule-to-start",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_activity_schedule_to_start_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_activity_schedule_to_start_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_activity_schedule_to_start_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "description": "QUEUE WAIT, not execution time \u2014 how long work sat before a Worker took it. The earliest customer-visible sign of an undersized fleet.\n\nIf this is suspiciously flat during a known backlog, you have set ScheduleToStartTimeout in ActivityOptions; it truncates the metric and hides the problem. Leave it unset.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#ec835a",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#9ec5f4"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5598e7"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p99"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Workflow end-to-end latency",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_workflow_endtoend_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_workflow_endtoend_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_workflow_endtoend_latency_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The metric closest to what your users actually feel.\n\nNote the SDK's default buckets stop at 10s: anything slower lands in +Inf and the quantile flattens against that ceiling. If your Workflows routinely exceed 10s, configure custom histogram buckets in your Worker.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#9ec5f4"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5598e7"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p99"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Have I got capacity?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Worker slot utilisation",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (worker_type) (temporal_worker_task_slots_used{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"})\n/ clamp_min(\n    sum by (worker_type) (temporal_worker_task_slots_used{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"})\n  + sum by (worker_type) (temporal_worker_task_slots_available{namespace=\"$namespace\", task_queue=\"$task_queue\"}), 1)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{worker_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "At 100% with LOW host CPU, raise MaxConcurrentActivityExecutionSize \u2014 do not add Workers. At 100% with HIGH host CPU, add Workers.\n\nHost CPU is not a Temporal metric. Without it from your platform team these two cases are indistinguishable and the fixes are opposite.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#ec835a",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Can my Workers reach Temporal?",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(temporal_request_total{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "requests"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(temporal_request_failure_total{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "failures"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Your Workers' own calls to the Temporal Service. Separates 'my code is broken' from 'I cannot reach the platform' \u2014 which is a conversation with your platform team, not a code change.\n\ntemporal_request_failure_total is absent until the first failure, so a missing line is silent, not healthy.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "requests"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3987e5"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failures"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#d03b3b"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
